                                    },
                                    "id": "only_multiply_leaks",
                                    "text": "Only the mul instruction out of all the integer_ops instructions leaks timing information.",
                                    "comments": [
                                        {
                                            "pos": {
                                                "line": 36,
                                                "col": 0
                                            },
                                            "text": "These are not consistent with each other, you should"
                                        },
